# Never commit artifacts — Drive is their source of truth
*.pptx
*.gslides
*.gdoc
*.gsheet
*.docx
*.xlsx
*.zip

# Local working output
deck_work/
*_inventory_*.csv
*.bak

# Credentials — never commit
*.json
!package.json
!pipeline_invariants.json
credentials*
token*
.env

# OS noise
.DS_Store

# Rescued governing documents from the Red Clay school drive (2026-08-29).
# The blanket artifact rules above stay — these are scoped exceptions for
# documents whose only other copy is on a district account with a clock on it.
!docs/tpt/originals/*.docx
!docs/tpt/originals/*.xlsx

# The live-deck fingerprint. Captured from the 24 live decks on 2026-08-30, not
# generated from anything in here, so the blanket *.json credential rule would
# lose it. scripts/live_deck_check.py compares later runs against it.
!docs/live_baseline.json

# Audit outputs are records, not working output. The *_inventory_*.csv rule above
# is for scratch inventories; these are kept deliberately. (2026-08-29)
!audits/*.csv

# Full snapshot of the TPT Drive folder (06 TPT/TEACHERS PAY TEACHERS (Shared)),
# taken 2026-08-30 before flattening it and before removing anything from Drive.
# 21 of these files existed nowhere else. The extension rules above would swallow
# most of them, so this exception is deliberate and must not be narrowed.
!docs/tpt-drive-snapshot/**

# The book project's own documents. The *.docx rule above would swallow these,
# and on 30 August it nearly took AnswerableTeachingPrefaceCh5.docx after the
# only other copy had been deleted from the Desktop. Do not narrow this.
!docs/book-project/*.docx

# Scoped exceptions, 30 August 2026. The blanket artifact rules above kept
# swallowing deliverables whose only other copy was on a Drive that was about
# to be cleared. Rules are by extension; exceptions are by path.
!audits/*.docx
!docs/curriculum/*.docx
!docs/pipeline-v1-archive/*.docx
!docs/pipeline-v1-archive/*.xlsx
!archive/katherine-ops-plugin-scaffolding/*.json

# AI operations private runtime/cache artifacts
ai-ops/runtime/__pycache__/
ai-ops/runtime/tests/__pycache__/
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-*
